exit 0
--- stdout
deedglass · the execution and accountability layer for AI agents

Usage  deedglass <command> [flags]

Setup
  init                Set up Deedglass in this directory
  doctor              Check config, database and keys
  scan                Show what your agent setup can change
  play                Watch the 301 scene offline, no Docker
  serve               Run the API, the rules and the Console
  migrate             Apply or check database migrations                      up · status · verify
  config print        Show the effective config, secrets hidden
  version             Show the client and server versions
  keys                Manage seal keys                                        gen · rotate · list
  licence             Turn on Pro, or check this machine's licence            activate · show · refresh · deactivate
  vault               Check or rotate the credential vault                    status · rotate
  completion          Print shell completion                                  zsh · bash · fish
Agents
  agent               Register and control agents                             create · list · show · suspend · resume · stop · start
  agent keys          Manage an agent's API keys                              create · list · roll · revoke
  agent intent        Manage an agent's signed-intent keys                    keygen · add · list · remove · mode
  org                 Create orgs and keys; stop or start all                 create · login-link · keys · stop-all · start-all
Policies
  policy              Write, test and activate policies                       lint · fmt · test · push · activate · evaluate · replay · diff · install
  policy packs        List or check the policy packs                          list · verify
  guard shell         Check a shell command before an agent runs it
Actions
  act                 Send a test action through Deedglass
  actions             Inspect actions                                         list · show · cancel
  approve · deny      Decide a pending approval
  approvals           List pending approvals                                  list · show
  undo                Preview or run an undo                                  preview · run
  observe             Watch what changed while an agent ran                   run · start · stop · list · show · undo · exclude
  webhooks            Send events to your endpoints                           create · list · test · delete
Records
  verify              Check records offline
  security-pack       Answer a security review from your records              readiness · build · verify
  report              Report what your agents did in a week or month
  clients             List every org you look after (Agency plan)
  deeds               Browse and export records                               list · show · share · export · seal-file
  ledger              Check or prune the Ledger                               check · prune
Connectors
  connector           Connect tools                                           create · list · show · test · types · credentials
  connector postgres  Prepare a Postgres database                             init · check
  connector gmail     Authorize the Gmail connector                           authorize
  decoder             Inspect Postgres change readers                         status · drop
  slack manifest      Print the Slack app manifest
MCP
  mcp                 Put Deedglass in front of MCP servers                   wrap · serve · snippet · install-links
Insights
  insights            Suggestions, shadow results and anomalies               stats · shadow · anomalies · detect · settings · suggestions · digest
Dev
  dev                 Local helpers                                           seed · fake-action · simulate · agent-script · mail-preview · sign-intent · stripe-fixtures

Global flags  --json · --server <url> · --api-key <key> · --org <id> · --no-color · -v
Run deedglass help <command> for details · https://docs.deedglass.com
